1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:10,175
SEO is like growing your own vegetables: cheap, slow, lasting. Ads are buying at the market: instant, but you pay every time.

2
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:19,980
Search ads catch people already searching. Social ads show your product to people who match an audience, before they were searching.

3
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:28,755
On Google, add negative keywords, like free or jobs, so you do not pay for the wrong clicks.

4
00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:36,385
On social ads, retarget people who visited your site. They are far more likely to buy.

5
00:00:37,080 --> 00:00:45,530
Test one change at a time: headline, image, or audience. Let the numbers decide, and give tests enough time.

6
00:00:47,230 --> 00:00:58,730
Spend fifty thousand, get four hundred clicks and twenty sales worth two hundred thousand. Cost per sale: two thousand five hundred. Return: four to one.

7
00:00:59,430 --> 00:01:08,855
Always compare cost per sale with your profit per sale, not the price. And make sure the landing page keeps the ad's promise.

